              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/opfibration"} opfibration
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+categories"} strict categories
              formed in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/1-category"} 1-category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+categories"} strict categories
              may be understood as modelling the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-pullback"} 2-pullback
              (cf.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "2-pullback#StrictPullback"} there
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cospan"} cospan
              in the actual
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category"} 2-category
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cat"} Cat
            %p
              In particular, if the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+categories"} strict categories
              involved in the pullback diagram
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:StrictPullbackOfOpfibration"} (5)
              are all
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/groupoids"} groupoids
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ϕ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \phi
              being a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+fibration"} Kan fibration
              is equivalent to its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nerve"} nerve
              being a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+fibration"} Kan fibration
              (see at
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+Kan+fibration"} right Kan fibration
              %a{:href => "right%2Fleft+Kan+fibration#FibrationInGroupoidsAsRightKanFibrations"} this and
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "right%2Fleft+Kan+fibration#OverKanComplex"} this Prop
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:StrictPullbackOfOpfibration"} (5)
              models the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullback"} homotopy pullback
              (by
              = succeed ")." do
