              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck"} Grothendieck
              1959.
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jon+Beck"} Jon Beck
              and
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Claude+Chevalley"} Claude Chevalley
              studied it independently from each another. &amp;lbrack;…&amp;rbrack; It is conspicuous that neither of them ever published anything on it. &amp;lbrack;
